{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Save the Earth, or Not(STEON)'\u00a0</strong>is a top-down shooter roguelite set in the vastness of space. Your mission is to defeat powerful, pattern-based bosses, collect 'Special Stones', and save the dying Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd34 Color Stone Weapon System:</strong> The six colored 'Color Stones', dropped by glowing purple enemies, instantly become your weapons. Combine different colors or collect just one to create powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude3a Trade with Cat Merchants:</strong> Even after you're fully armed, 'Color Stones' aren't useless. Use them as currency to buy weapon upgrades or special stats from wandering cat merchants in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Diverse Skills:</strong> Use 'Skill Fuel', dropped by gray enemies, to turn the battle in your favor. A variety of skills are at your disposal, including an emergency dodge to escape dangerous situations, a shockwave to blast enemies away, and a focused attack for a burst of firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Permanent Ship Upgrades:</strong> Game over isn't the end. Permanently upgrade your ship at the 'Upgrade Center' on the title screen to make your next run easier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a <strong>single-player</strong> experience</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100 in one go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/fea9a6d201ba3fa9cb8c110755ed55371923e943.jpg"},{"name":"500 in one go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/1ebea780653706266657c902d09871639813d2a0.jpg"},{"name":"1000 in one go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/fb4cf3eca47d264bc44081fac106a28afa1445ed.jpg"},{"name":"First Boss Defeated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/5a724cbf63ba6c648e537449869c6510383a1917.jpg"},{"name":"Second Boss Defeated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/e1d39ec93bb13c785777115af87d508461f4a61f.jpg"},{"name":"Third Boss Defeated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/764081d89ad1c45b6df1bbfce17b72f912235c75.jpg"},{"name":"Churu for Mayo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/eb0bd6c9edf38ce813646c823360680d5ff90018.jpg"},{"name":"Snacks for Nuri","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/d096172a78b782363109c3d704d7a5e60ca46944.jpg"},{"name":"Savior of the Cat Planet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/b00c0111d288517559d8625e6faed213309cc1a0.jpg"},{"name":"Earth Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950330/a4a1b29b3e397cc4d024f569a4a24645d7a7e3f2.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950330?t=1757322561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950330?t=1757322561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950330/7aaa8581daa6ca184753e8d097f2e82c27821854/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757322561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950330/7aaa8581daa6ca184753e8d097f2e82c27821854/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757322561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Save the Earth, or Not(STEON)'\u00a0</strong>is a top-down shooter roguelite set in the vastness of space. Your mission is to defeat powerful, pattern-based bosses, collect 'Special Stones', and save the dying Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd34 Color Stone Weapon System:</strong> The six colored 'Color Stones', dropped by glowing purple enemies, instantly become your weapons. Combine different colors or collect just one to create powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude3a Trade with Cat Merchants:</strong> Even after you're fully armed, 'Color Stones' aren't useless. Use them as currency to buy weapon upgrades or special stats from wandering cat merchants in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Diverse Skills:</strong> Use 'Skill Fuel', dropped by gray enemies, to turn the battle in your favor. A variety of skills are at your disposal, including an emergency dodge to escape dangerous situations, a shockwave to blast enemies away, and a focused attack for a burst of firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Permanent Ship Upgrades:</strong> Game over isn't the end. Permanently upgrade your ship at the 'Upgrade Center' on the title screen to make your next run easier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a <strong>single-player</strong> experience</p>","developers":["MayoNuriGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950330/95bcaec33a4c096fb85ac428e51